                    Readme instructions for Tclpp

	          The Tclpp Home Page is located at

          http://www.geocities.com/ssinnige/projects/tclpp/

======================================================================

	1. Documentation
	2. Compilation and Installation
	3. Author and Bug Reports
	4. Copyright and Licensing

1. Documentation

    Documentation of Tclpp is available in the ./doc directory. The
    actual documentation can be created by running 'make' It will
    create the 'tclpp.html' manual and UNIX manual pages. 

2. Compilation and Installation

    For compilation and installation, see the 'INSTALL' file.

3. Author and Bug Reports

    This software package is implemented by Stefan Sinnige. You can
    reach him at

    		ssinnige@geocities.com

    If you find any problems, bugs or have suggestions, please send an
    e-mail to (one of) the addresses above.

